# Exclude everything from the Docker build context.
# The ! lines below re-include only the path to the distribution archive.
# Without this, Docker would send the entire repository (several GB) as context.
**

# Re-include only the distribution archive and its parent directories.
# Each directory level must be un-ignored for Docker to traverse to the file.
!quarkus/
!quarkus/dist/
!quarkus/dist/target/
!quarkus/dist/target/keycloak-*.tar.gz
